{"4082940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Panic Protocol", "steam_appid": 4082940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic Protocol is a 1-4 online co-op horror game, where one player controls a security camera system. They can use this system to detect and call out enemies and guide their teammates through the facility. They can also use it to trigger environmental traps and interact with the environment. The Panic Team must locate the research cases around the map, listen to the observer and hide from enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the security system to guide your friends...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082940/extras/c39d5e768811ec4ef47d4b9d232fc333.poster.avif?t=1788201445\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082940/extras/c39d5e768811ec4ef47d4b9d232fc333.webm?t=1788201445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082940/extras/c39d5e768811ec4ef47d4b9d232fc333.mp4?t=1788201445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or navigate the facility on foot and outwit the enemy...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082940/extras/0d5c9e0ec68c6bfa7395f0f92957f937.poster.avif?t=1788201445\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082940/extras/0d5c9e0ec68c6bfa7395f0f92957f937.webm?t=1788201445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it